import fs from'node:fs/promises';import path from'node:path';import assert from'node:assert/strict';import{createHash}from'node:crypto';import{spawnSync}from'node:child_process';const here=import.meta.dirname,workspace=path.resolve(here,'../..'),repo=path.join(workspace,'outputs/rea-research-lab'),sha=b=>createHash('sha256').update(b).digest('hex'),app='products/rea-studio/apps/sketch',prefix=app+'/results/layout-followup',correction=path.join(workspace,'work/sketch-layout-precision-next');async function keep(p,b){const q=path.join(here,p);await fs.mkdir(path.dirname(q),{recursive:true});await fs.writeFile(q,b,{flag:'wx'});}async function tree(d,p=''){const out=[];for(const e of await fs.readdir(d,{withFileTypes:true})){assert(!e.isSymbolicLink());if(e.isDirectory())out.push(...await tree(path.join(d,e.name),p+e.name+'/'));else out.push(p+e.name);}return out;}
const definitions=[['initial-candidate','sketch-alignment-next','freeze-manifest.json','4684a6dffad102c461531476d4c24ad8b8eb5783b226aad9bbf82e2b81e0f2c7',277],['negative-review','sketch-alignment-independent-review','review-manifest.json','fed8216fa2a85da04ea0d2a16750f1fbb3891959f122272adb05222019f85559',111],['correction','sketch-layout-precision-next','freeze-manifest.json','1dd88ded543ef519876546a668ad6e258755a87bf07fd7eb563d4f707b66ffd1',188],['acceptance-review','sketch-layout-precision-independent-review','review-manifest.json','18368b293f97a573332c161bf3d6adc699b9367ab78a5a0fe44ffd2fa5b65653',81]],epochs=[],publicRows=[],scan={files:0,bytes:0,nativeHeaderMatches:[],archiveExecutablePathMatches:[],credentialMarkerMatches:[],absoluteWorkspacePaths:[],interpretation:'Read-only header/path/credential-marker triage of exact source/evidence payload. Synthetic fixture values and author workspace paths are retained; no claim of exhaustive secret or personal-data detection.'};
for(const[epoch,folder,name,pin,count]of definitions){const root=path.join(workspace,'work',folder),mb=await fs.readFile(path.join(root,name));assert.equal(sha(mb),pin);const m=JSON.parse(mb);assert.equal(m.files,count);assert.deepEqual((await tree(root)).sort(),[...m.records.map(r=>r.path),name].sort());const rows=[...m.records,{path:name,bytes:mb.length,sha256:sha(mb)}];for(const r of rows){const b=await fs.readFile(path.join(root,r.path));assert.equal(b.length,r.bytes);assert.equal(sha(b),r.sha256,r.path);const source='work/'+folder+'/'+r.path,destination=prefix+'/'+epoch+'/frozen/'+r.path+'.snapshot';assert(!destination.includes('/.local/'));publicRows.push({epoch,source,originalPath:r.path,destination,bytes:r.bytes,sha256:r.sha256,transformation:'Exact bytes; filename gains .snapshot; existing suffixes remain.'});scan.files++;scan.bytes+=b.length;const head=b.subarray(0,8).toString('hex');if(head.startsWith('4d5a')||head.startsWith('504b0304')||head.startsWith('504b0506')||head.startsWith('1f8b')||head.startsWith('377abcaf271c')||head.startsWith('7f454c46'))scan.nativeHeaderMatches.push(source);if(/\.(exe|dll|zip|7z|tgz|gz|tar|zst)$/i.test(r.path))scan.archiveExecutablePathMatches.push(source);if(/-----BEGIN (?:RSA |EC |OPENSSH )?PRIVATE KEY-----|AIza[0-9A-Za-z_-]{35}|gh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{30,}|sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{40,}/.test(b.toString()))scan.credentialMarkerMatches.push(source);if(b.includes(Buffer.from('C:\\Users\\evanh'))||b.includes(Buffer.from('C:/Users/evanh')))scan.absoluteWorkspacePaths.push(source);}epochs.push({epoch,sourceRoot:'work/'+folder,manifest:name,manifestSHA256:pin,records:count,manifestIncludedAlias:true,proposedAliases:rows.length});}
assert.equal(publicRows.length,661);assert.equal(scan.nativeHeaderMatches.length,0);assert.equal(scan.archiveExecutablePathMatches.length,0);assert.equal(scan.credentialMarkerMatches.length,0);assert.equal(new Set(publicRows.map(r=>r.destination)).size,publicRows.length);await keep('public-alias-copy-list.json',JSON.stringify({schema:'rea-sketch-layout-public-alias-copy-list/v1',destinationBase:'outputs/rea-research-lab',publicAliases:661,epochs,records:publicRows,physicalDedupAllowed:false,allFrozenBytesExact:true,generatedNativeArchives:0,proposedOnly:true},null,2)+'\n');await keep('payload-scan.json',JSON.stringify(scan,null,2)+'\n');
const baseline=JSON.parse(await fs.readFile(path.join(correction,'source-baseline.json')));assert.equal(baseline.length,14);for(const r of baseline){const b=await fs.readFile(path.join(repo,r.path));assert.equal(b.length,r.bytes);assert.equal(sha(b),r.sha256);await keep('baseline/'+r.path+'.snapshot',b);}await keep('external-baseline14.json',JSON.stringify({schema:'rea-sketch-layout-plan-production-baseline/v1',at:new Date().toISOString(),rows:baseline,currentProductionUnchanged:true,wholeLabClaim:false},null,2)+'\n');
const adaptations=[],live=[];async function propose(source,destination,replacements=[]){const b=await fs.readFile(path.join(correction,source));let text=b.toString();for(const[a,z]of replacements){assert(text.includes(a),'Required exact adapter anchor: '+source+' '+a);text=text.replaceAll(a,z);}const proposed=Buffer.from(text),local='proposed-live/'+path.basename(destination);await keep(local,proposed);let prior=null;try{const x=await fs.readFile(path.join(repo,destination));prior={bytes:x.length,sha256:sha(x)};}catch(e){if(e.code!=='ENOENT')throw e;}live.push({source:'work/sketch-layout-publication-plan/'+local,destination,bytes:proposed.length,sha256:sha(proposed),mode:prior?'replace':'add',prior,origin:'work/sketch-layout-precision-next/'+source,originSHA256:sha(b),exactOrigin:replacements.length===0});if(replacements.length)adaptations.push({source,sourceSHA256:sha(b),destination,proposedSHA256:sha(proposed),replacements,fixturesAssertionsOriginalBodiesEdited:false,scope:'Runtime/test imports and owned observation/source-authentication paths only.'});}
await propose(app+'/client.mjs',app+'/client.mjs');await propose(app+'/README.md',app+'/README.md');await propose(app+'/layout.mjs',app+'/layout.mjs');
const common=[["'./products/rea-studio/apps/sketch/layout.mjs'","'./layout.mjs'"],["'./products/rea-studio/apps/sketch/core.mjs'","'./core.mjs'"],["'./layout-oracle.mjs'","'./layout-original-oracle.mjs'"]];await propose('layout.test.mjs',app+'/layout.test.mjs',[...common,["import path from 'node:path';","import path from 'node:path';import os from 'node:os';"],["const output=process.env.REA_LAYOUT_OBSERVATIONS;","const output=process.env.REA_LAYOUT_OBSERVATIONS||path.join(fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(),'rea-sketch-layout-')),'original-actions.json');"]]);await propose('precision.test.mjs',app+'/precision.test.mjs',[...common,["import path from 'node:path';","import path from 'node:path';import os from 'node:os';"],["const shape=","const observationDirectory=process.env.REA_LAYOUT_PRECISION_OBSERVATIONS||fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(),'rea-sketch-precision-'));\nconst shape="],["path.join(process.env.REA_LAYOUT_PRECISION_OBSERVATIONS,label+'.json')","path.join(observationDirectory,label+'.json')"]]);await propose('layout-ui.test.mjs',app+'/layout-ui.test.mjs',[["'./products/rea-studio/apps/sketch/server.mjs'","'./server.mjs'"]]);await propose('layout-ui-fixture.mjs',app+'/layout-ui-fixture.mjs',[["'./products/rea-studio/apps/sketch/client.mjs'","'./client.mjs'"],["'./products/rea-studio/apps/sketch/server.mjs'","'./server.mjs'"]]);
const prov=await fs.readFile(path.join(correction,'source-provenance.json')),provSHA=sha(prov),guard="const provenancePath=path.join(root,'results/layout-followup/correction/frozen/source-provenance.json.snapshot'),provenanceBytes=fs.readFileSync(provenancePath);assert.equal(hash(provenanceBytes),'"+provSHA+"','Pinned original layout provenance');assert.equal(hash(fs.readFileSync(process.execPath)),'b3094d0b49f9ad602262a9921551737bb97637c05dd357a06ae98188d7290aa3','Pinned Node layout oracle runtime');const provenance=JSON.parse(provenanceBytes),sourceRows=[],parts=[];assert.equal(provenance.release,'@excalidraw/excalidraw 0.18.1');assert.equal(provenance.commit,'a2ec2889babf7d2295469c6d90ebe77fae57df84');assert.equal(provenance.fetched.length,8);";await propose('layout-oracle.mjs',app+'/layout-original-oracle.mjs',[["const provenance=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(root,'source-provenance.json'))),sourceRows=[],parts=[];",guard],["b=fs.readFileSync(path.join(root,filename))","b=fs.readFileSync(path.join(root,'results/layout-followup/correction/frozen',filename+'.snapshot'))"],["assert.equal(hash(b),r.sha256);","assert.ok(r,'Pinned original source row');assert.equal(b.length,r.bytes);assert.equal(hash(b),r.sha256);"],["sourceRows.push({path:filename,","sourceRows.push({path:'results/layout-followup/correction/frozen/'+filename+'.snapshot',originalPath:filename,"]]);assert.equal(live.length,8);assert.equal(live.filter(r=>r.mode==='replace').length,2);assert.equal(live.filter(r=>r.mode==='add').length,6);for(const r of live){assert(!r.destination.includes('/results/'));assert(!r.source.includes('/outputs/'));}
await keep('live-install-copy-list.json',JSON.stringify({schema:'rea-sketch-layout-prospective-live-install/v1',app:'sketch',files:8,replace:2,add:6,records:live,sharedHostRouteOwnedByRoot:true,sharedHostFilesIncluded:0,behaviorVerification:false,actualInstalledAcceptance:false},null,2)+'\n');await keep('test-path-adaptations.json',JSON.stringify({schema:'rea-sketch-layout-current-path-adapters/v1',records:adaptations,originalFunctionBodiesFixturesAssertionsUnchanged:true,details:'The test-only oracle adds release/source/Node authentication guards and reads exact inert aliases. Test observations default to per-run os.tmpdir; collector env overrides remain supported. No app/results writes by normal tests.'},null,2)+'\n');
const census=[];for(const p of['app.test.mjs','client.test.mjs','geometry-client.test.mjs','geometry.test.mjs','vendor-oracle.test.mjs','layout.test.mjs','precision.test.mjs','layout-ui.test.mjs']){const added=live.find(r=>r.destination===app+'/'+p),b=await fs.readFile(added?path.join(here,added.source.slice('work/sketch-layout-publication-plan/'.length)):path.join(repo,app,p)),count=(b.toString().match(/^test\(/gm)||[]).length;census.push({path:app+'/'+p,bytes:b.length,sha256:sha(b),topLevelTestGroups:count,status:added?'prospective path-only adapter':'existing current source'});}assert.equal(census.slice(0,3).reduce((n,r)=>n+r.topLevelTestGroups,0),19);assert.equal(census.slice(5).reduce((n,r)=>n+r.topLevelTestGroups,0),11);assert.equal(census.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.topLevelTestGroups,0),39);await keep('proposed-test-census.json',JSON.stringify({schema:'rea-sketch-layout-prospective-test-census/v1',method:'Source enumeration of exact top-level test declarations; no tests executed.',files:census,newFiles:3,newGroups:11,focusedAuthorSelection:{files:census.filter((r,i)=>i<3||i>=5).map(r=>r.path),groups:30,existing:19,new:11,originalActionPairs:3968,integerAuthor1944:1944,fractionalReviewReplay24:24,newAuthorFractional2000:2000,independentFresh78Included:false},expandedSketchSelection:{files:census.map(r=>r.path),groups:39,existing:28,new:11,vendorOriginalCacheNeeded:true},rootFutureHTTPRouteTestsNotCounted:true},null,2)+'\n');
const syntax=[];for(const r of live.filter(r=>r.destination.endsWith('.mjs'))){const file=path.join(here,r.source.slice('work/sketch-layout-publication-plan/'.length)),x=spawnSync(process.execPath,['--check',file],{encoding:'utf8',windowsHide:true});syntax.push({path:r.source,sha256:r.sha256,exitCode:x.status,stdout:x.stdout,stderr:x.stderr});assert.equal(x.status,0);}await keep('syntax-only.json',JSON.stringify({checks:syntax.length,records:syntax,codeEvaluated:false,testsExecuted:false,originalEvaluations:0},null,2)+'\n');
const registries=[],sources=[],capabilities=[];for(const name of['workspace-products','visual-products','system-products']){const p='products/rea-studio/requirements/'+name+'.json',b=await fs.readFile(path.join(repo,p)),j=JSON.parse(b);registries.push({path:p,bytes:b.length,sha256:sha(b)});for(const r of j.sources)sources.push({registry:name+'.json',id:r.id,sha256:r.sha256});const caps=name==='workspace-products'?j.capabilities:name==='visual-products'?j.baselineProducts.flatMap(p=>p.requirements):j.products.flatMap(p=>p.capabilities);for(const r of caps)capabilities.push({registry:name+'.json',id:r.id});}assert.equal(sources.length,159);assert.equal(capabilities.length,232);const prior=JSON.parse(await fs.readFile(path.join(workspace,'work/vault-recycle-publication-plan/requirements-binding.json')));assert.deepEqual(sources,prior.originalSources);assert.deepEqual(capabilities,prior.capabilityIds);await keep('requirements-binding.json',JSON.stringify({schema:'rea-sketch-layout-prospective-requirements-binding/v1',at:new Date().toISOString(),registries,originalSources:sources,originalCapabilityIds:capabilities,counts:{sources:159,capabilities:232},exactHistoricalIdentityProjection:true,registriesModified:false,onlyFiniteSupplementProposed:true},null,2)+'\n');
